    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t panic!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PANIK is a puzzle game where you have to guide different characters to the goal. Sounds easy... but, can you manage it without panicking?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/3be495c513cb2c9201a2efca1bc4d9c7.poster.avif?t=1753121838\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/3be495c513cb2c9201a2efca1bc4d9c7.webm?t=1753121838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/3be495c513cb2c9201a2efca1bc4d9c7.mp4?t=1753121838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The panikers are scared and can\u2019t move!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out how to calm these creatures and guide them to safety. Complete over 100 levels spread across 8 unique worlds and uncover all the challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/68b8e2c5ad8d5d7296993eef0a538a2a.poster.avif?t=1753121838\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/68b8e2c5ad8d5d7296993eef0a538a2a.webm?t=1753121838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/68b8e2c5ad8d5d7296993eef0a538a2a.mp4?t=1753121838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the panikers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you seen the one wearing a crown? What about the one with the magician\u2019s hat? Or the robot? There\u2019s even a ninja! Each one has unique abilities to help (or not) you solve each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/9daeb4c82d4d3212a9e3a2009c1e4d4d.poster.avif?t=1753121838\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/9daeb4c82d4d3212a9e3a2009c1e4d4d.webm?t=1753121838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/9daeb4c82d4d3212a9e3a2009c1e4d4d.mp4?t=1753121838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 levels spread across 8 worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 panikers with unique abilities. (Or maybe it's 15?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bit of humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of panik!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t panic!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PANIK is a puzzle game where you have to guide different characters to the goal. Sounds easy... but, can you manage it without panicking?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/3be495c513cb2c9201a2efca1bc4d9c7.poster.avif?t=1753121838\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/3be495c513cb2c9201a2efca1bc4d9c7.webm?t=1753121838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/3be495c513cb2c9201a2efca1bc4d9c7.mp4?t=1753121838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The panikers are scared and can\u2019t move!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out how to calm these creatures and guide them to safety. Complete over 100 levels spread across 8 unique worlds and uncover all the challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/68b8e2c5ad8d5d7296993eef0a538a2a.poster.avif?t=1753121838\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/68b8e2c5ad8d5d7296993eef0a538a2a.webm?t=1753121838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/68b8e2c5ad8d5d7296993eef0a538a2a.mp4?t=1753121838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the panikers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you seen the one wearing a crown? What about the one with the magician\u2019s hat? Or the robot? There\u2019s even a ninja! Each one has unique abilities to help (or not) you solve each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/9daeb4c82d4d3212a9e3a2009c1e4d4d.poster.avif?t=1753121838\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/9daeb4c82d4d3212a9e3a2009c1e4d4d.webm?t=1753121838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/9daeb4c82d4d3212a9e3a2009c1e4d4d.mp4?t=1753121838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 levels spread across 8 worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 panikers with unique abilities. (Or maybe it's 15?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bit of humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of panik!</p></li></ul>",
